{%- case field -%}
{%- when 'group' -%}wellness
{%- when 'wellness' -%}
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>Who is it for? <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.who_is_it_for != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.who_is_it_for | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>Anyone who wants a natural bathing powder<br> Someone searching for de-tanning products<br> Anyone experiencing strawberry legs and rough skin texture<br> Anyone with sensitive skin that is prone to redness and allergies</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>Ingredients <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.ingredients != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.ingredients | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>Green Moong, Rice, Kalonji, Masoor Dal, Poolankalingu, Vasambu, Vetiver, Rose, Chandan Powder, Neem, Orange Peel, Tulsi Leaves, Liquorice, Kasturi Manjal, Daru Haridra, Aloe Vera, Manjishtha, Edible Camphor.</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>What is it? <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.what_is_it != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.what_is_it | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>This is a powder based cleansing scrub that is made with natural herbs, flowers &amp; roots that are sundried &amp; handcrushed. It keeps the skin soft, reduces strawberry legs and de-tans the skin. Especially great for the summer.</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>What makes it different <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.why_it_is_unique != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.why_it_is_unique | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>This is an ancient Ayurvedic recipe for a body scrub that is skin friendly &amp; earth friendly. Made with a 100% natural recipe, it is a great substitute for body washes &amp; soaps, especially for sensitive skin.</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>Disclaimer <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.disclaimer != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.disclaimer | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p>A patch test is mandatory. If the product or a natural ingredient irritates your skin, please stop using it immediately. Please consult your naturopath or physician before using these products.</p>{% endif %}</div></details>
{%- endcase -%}
